<section class="sensol-shipping-detail-section">
  <div class="sensol-shipping-detail">
    <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__divider"></div>

    <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-shipping-detail__num">01</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-shipping-detail__title">Shipping rates &amp; coverage</h2>
      <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__body">
        <p>Sensol Fitness offers <strong>free standard shipping</strong> on all orders delivered to Australian metropolitan areas. Your Sensol system ships from our Melbourne fulfilment centre via our trusted logistics partners.</p>
        <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__table-wrap">
          <table class="sensol-shipping-detail__table">
            <thead><tr><th>Destination</th><th>Rate</th><th>Carrier</th><th>Transit Time</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td><strong>Australia Metro</strong><br>Sydney, Melbourne, Brisbane, Perth, Adelaide</td><td>Free</td><td>Allied / Hunter / TGE</td><td>5&ndash;10 business days</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>Australia Regional</strong><br>Up to 100km from metro centres</td><td>$80&ndash;$180 AUD</td><td>Allied / Hunter Express</td><td>7&ndash;12 business days</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>Australia Remote</strong><br>Northern Territory, far North QLD, rural WA</td><td>$180&ndash;$350 AUD</td><td>TGE IPEC / Direct Freight</td><td>10&ndash;15 business days</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>United States</strong><br>Continental US (from sensolfitness.com)</td><td>Calculated</td><td>FedEx Freight / UPS</td><td>7&ndash;14 business days</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p>Remote and regional shipping rates are calculated at checkout based on your delivery postcode. All rates are displayed in full before you complete your purchase.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-shipping-detail__num">02</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-shipping-detail__title">Product dimensions &amp; handling</h2>
      <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__body">
        <p>Sensol products are large-format fitness equipment requiring specialised freight handling. Each order is professionally packed in reinforced packaging with custom foam inserts.</p>
        <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__table-wrap">
          <table class="sensol-shipping-detail__table">
            <thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Gross Weight</th><th>Package</th><th>Boxes</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td><strong>FLEX AIR</strong></td><td>28 kg</td><td>1750 x 625 x 190 mm</td><td>3</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>FLEX PRO</strong></td><td>42 kg</td><td>2040 x 680 x 180 mm</td><td>1</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>RS03</strong></td><td>47 kg</td><td>2040 x 680 x 180 mm</td><td>1</td></tr>
              <tr><td><strong>RS03 PRO</strong></td><td>52 kg</td><td>2040 x 680 x 180 mm</td><td>1</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p>Due to the size and weight of our products, deliveries are made curbside or to your building's ground-floor entrance. For apartment buildings with lift access, the driver will deliver to your floor where possible.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-shipping-detail__num">03</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-shipping-detail__title">Order processing &amp; tracking</h2>
      <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__body">
        <ol class="sensol-shipping-detail__steps">
          <li class="sensol-shipping-detail__step"><span class="sensol-shipping-detail__step-num">1</span><div><h4>Order confirmed</h4><p>You will receive an order confirmation email immediately after purchase. Your order enters our fulfilment queue at our Melbourne warehouse.</p></div></li>
          <li class="sensol-shipping-detail__step"><span class="sensol-shipping-detail__step-num">2</span><div><h4>Processing</h4><p>Orders are processed within <strong>1&ndash;2 business days</strong>. During peak periods or product launches, processing may extend to 3 business days.</p></div></li>
          <li class="sensol-shipping-detail__step"><span class="sensol-shipping-detail__step-num">3</span><div><h4>Dispatched</h4><p>Once your order leaves our Melbourne fulfilment centre, you will receive a shipping confirmation email with your <strong>tracking number</strong> and carrier details.</p></div></li>
          <li class="sensol-shipping-detail__step"><span class="sensol-shipping-detail__step-num">4</span><div><h4>In transit</h4><p>Track your delivery in real time via the carrier's online portal. Our logistics partners will contact you to schedule a convenient delivery window.</p></div></li>
          <li class="sensol-shipping-detail__step"><span class="sensol-shipping-detail__step-num">5</span><div><h4>Delivered</h4><p>Inspect your package upon arrival. Any visible damage must be noted with the driver. <strong>Photograph any damage</strong> before opening and contact us within 48 hours.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-shipping-detail__num">04</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-shipping-detail__title">International orders</h2>
      <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__body">
        <p>For customers purchasing through <strong>sensolfitness.com</strong> (United States), orders are fulfilled from our US distribution network. International shipments outside Australia and the United States are available upon request. Contact <strong>support@sensolfitness.com</strong> with your delivery address for a custom shipping quote.</p>
        <p>International orders may be subject to customs duties, import taxes, and clearance fees imposed by the destination country. These charges are the responsibility of the recipient and are not included in the shipping rate displayed at checkout.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-shipping-detail__num">05</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-shipping-detail__title">Returns &amp; exchanges</h2>
      <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__body">
        <p>If your Sensol product arrives with a manufacturing defect, we will arrange return shipping at no cost to you under our <a class="sensol-shipping-detail__link" href="/pages/warranty">Warranty Policy</a>. For change-of-mind returns within 30 days of delivery, the product must be unused, in its original packaging, and in resellable condition. Return shipping costs for change-of-mind returns are the responsibility of the purchaser.</p>
        <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__highlight">
          <p class="sensol-shipping-detail__highlight-label">Important</p>
          <p class="sensol-shipping-detail__highlight-text">Do not dispose of your original packaging. In the event of a warranty claim or return, your product must be returned in its original packaging to ensure safe transport. Replacement packaging is available at cost.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__block">
      <p class="sensol-shipping-detail__num">06</p>
      <h2 class="sensol-shipping-detail__title">Lost or damaged shipments</h2>
      <div class="sensol-shipping-detail__body">
        <p>Every Sensol shipment is <strong>fully insured</strong> against loss and damage during transit. If your package arrives damaged:</p>
        <ul class="sensol-shipping-detail__exclusions">
          <li>Note the damage with the delivery driver at the time of receipt</li>
          <li>Photograph the damaged packaging and any damage to the product</li>
          <li>Contact <strong>support@sensolfitness.com.au</strong> within 48 hours</li>
          <li>Retain all packaging materials for carrier inspection</li>
        </ul>
        <p>For shipments that fail to arrive within the estimated transit window, we will initiate a carrier investigation and arrange a replacement or refund at our discretion.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}{"name":"SENSOL Shipping Detail","tag":"section","class":"sensol-shipping-detail-section","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"SENSOL Shipping Detail"}]}{% endschema %}

{%- style -%}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section{margin:0;padding:0;background:#F7F4F0}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail{max-width:1040px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 2rem 100px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__divider{width:48px;height:1px;background:#D4CEC6;margin:0 auto 100px}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__block{margin-bottom:88px}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__num{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B5ADA4;margin-bottom:0.5rem}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__title{font-size:clamp(2rem,3vw,2.75rem);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:2rem;color:#1A1816}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__body{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:500;color:#8A8279;line-height:1.75}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__body p{margin-bottom:1.25rem}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;margin:1.5rem 0}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:1.375rem;font-weight:500}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__table th{text-align:left;font-weight:600;font-size:1.125rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1A1816;padding:18px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CEC6;white-space:nowrap}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__table td{padding:20px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CEC6;color:#8A8279;line-height:1.65;font-size:1.375rem}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__exclusions{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0.75rem 2.5rem}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__exclusions li{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:500;color:#8A8279;padding:0.75rem 0 0.75rem 1.5rem;position:relative;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CEC6}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__exclusions li::before{content:'\2014';position:absolute;left:0;color:#B5ADA4;font-weight:500}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__highlight{background:#1A1816;color:#F7F4F0;padding:3rem 2.5rem;margin:2.5rem 0}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__highlight-label{font-size:1.25rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#B5ADA4;margin-bottom:0.75rem}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__highlight-text{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.65;max-width:650px}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__link{color:#1A1816;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-decoration-thickness:0.5px;text-decoration-color:#B5ADA4}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__steps{list-style:none}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__step{display:flex;gap:2rem;padding:2rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #D4CEC6}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__step:first-child{padding-top:0}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__step:last-child{border-bottom:none;padding-bottom:0}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__step-num{font-size:2.5rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1;color:#B5ADA4;flex-shrink:0;min-width:64px;text-align:right}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__step h4{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:500;color:#1A1816;margin-bottom:0.35rem}
.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__step p{font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:500;color:#8A8279;line-height:1.65}
@media(max-width:900px){.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__exclusions{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__table{font-size:1rem}.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__table td{padding:12px 12px;font-size:1.125rem}.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__table th{padding:12px 12px}}
@media(max-width:749px){.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail{padding:0 1.5rem 64px}.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__block{margin-bottom:56px}.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__divider{margin-bottom:64px}.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__step{flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem;padding:1.75rem 0}.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__step-num{text-align:left;font-size:1.5rem;min-width:auto;margin-bottom:0.25rem}.sensol-shipping-detail-section .sensol-shipping-detail__highlight{padding:2rem 1.5rem}}
{%- endstyle -%}
